// Copy this to `Local.xcconfig` — which is ignored — and fill it in. Both
// Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig include it with `#include?`, the optional
// form, so a clone without it builds fine: the archive this repository produces
// is unsigned, and signing happens outside it.

